1785292085206519	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyWA		item.create	bn-2y1u	{"description":"# Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The guide covers migration assessment, cutover/rollback, backup/verified restore, purge/redaction, semantic-epoch upgrades, and soundness incidents.\n- [ ] Migration B follows the guide and files every discovered gap as a documentation defect.\n- [ ] Recovery and removal procedures are exercised, not only reviewed.\n","kind":"task","labels":["docs","governance","phase-f"],"parent":"bn-281l","size":"m","title":"Migration, backup/restore, incident, and upgrade runbook validation"}	blake3:kwfFNKlYMezEol2X4DCB7vk7mI3_IK7aoJwS_EONFXM
1785292085278701	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyWQ		item.create	bn-1ma9	{"description":"# Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Native, observed tokio, instrumented tokio, production-monitoring, remote-worker, corpus, proof, and Forge lanes list supported claims, assumptions, observability, checker authority, and downgrade behavior.\n- [ ] Examples include honest Inconclusive and Unsupported outcomes.\n- [ ] Catalog entries are checked against capability/assurance schemas and release configuration.\n","kind":"task","labels":["docs","governance","phase-f"],"parent":"bn-1w93","size":"m","title":"Published assurance-envelope catalog for every shipped execution lane"}	blake3:e5W_Tl36RHDBWstJhXMrVRhirv7gi8OkNWCFBkCMnH0
1785292085352161	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyWg		item.create	bn-2ai3	{"description":"# Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Both migrations record compute, latency, storage, network, human maintenance, warm/cold behavior, variance, and hardware manifests at equal assurance.\n- [ ] Raw measurements are retained and compared with the replaced DST/TLA+ workflow.\n- [ ] G10 acceptability is decided against a policy fixed before the final measurements.\n","kind":"task","labels":["governance","phase-f","quality"],"parent":"bn-1w93","size":"m","title":"Two-migration operating-cost ledger and G10 acceptability decision"}	blake3:F8Xa8TIRyeu-XmTs2gyE0AkVrJjLoqhcFqRUqAgLHEA
