1785292278615519	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy5QE		item.update	bn-1ium	{"field":"description","value":"# Context\nWave 5 is the final integrated corpus stress lane. TLC, TCP, TLA+ level checking, and German cache coherence exercise different semantic and performance risks, so each family has an independent child rather than sharing one opaque leaf.\n\n# Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] All four families reach declared parity with deterministic oracle comparison.\n- [ ] Large closures, deep refinement, language semantics, symmetry, and industrial traces each have explicit performance/evidence reports.\n- [ ] Disagreements quarantine the affected claim and retain minimized fixtures."}	blake3:_u3bpPYaWB5jKCcabYzDhWE2KZAzqvDdci18WKsy24g
