1785346238136683	continuum-planner	itc:v3:AWLJM-cnJyfyRAAAAAAAQdW-666_qAAAAAEu1gc		item.create	bn-34je	{"description":"# Authoritative requirement\n`INV-001` — Protected intent\nSource: `notes/plan/plan.md:307`.\n\n# Contract\nOrdinary tasks may not mutate intent. Intent changes require a new Intent Contract, semantic diff, policy decision, and invalidation of dependent evidence.\n\n# Delivery and evidence\nImplement the invariant as an executable architectural guard and permanent regression. Include a mutant that would violate it and prove the guard detects it.\n\n- [ ] Implementation, policy, or experiment is complete at the cited scope.\n- [ ] Positive, negative, and boundary evidence is retained under stable artifact IDs.\n- [ ] Relevant clean, incremental, mutation, security, and documentation gates pass.\n- [ ] The requirement label remains attached to the evidence-owning Bone.","kind":"task","labels":["plan-key:invariant-inv-001","invariant","quality","req:inv-001","req:phase-a"],"parent":"bn-2br8","size":"s","title":"INV-001 — Protected intent"}	blake3:OqeWYZ_v2DO7UIsUZqL9yjBjK01P_suoxce3Rrtqsz0
