1785346238323219	continuum-planner	itc:v3:AWLJM-cnJyfyRAAAAAAAQdW-666_qAAAAAEu3Qc		item.create	bn-n9a1	{"description":"# Authoritative requirement\n`INV-008` — Typed inconclusiveness\nSource: `notes/plan/plan.md:335`.\n\n# Contract\nTimeout, unsupported semantics, insufficient telemetry, abstraction ambiguity, and incomplete proof search are distinct outcomes.\n\n# Delivery and evidence\nImplement the invariant as an executable architectural guard and permanent regression. Include a mutant that would violate it and prove the guard detects it.\n\n- [ ] Implementation, policy, or experiment is complete at the cited scope.\n- [ ] Positive, negative, and boundary evidence is retained under stable artifact IDs.\n- [ ] Relevant clean, incremental, mutation, security, and documentation gates pass.\n- [ ] The requirement label remains attached to the evidence-owning Bone.","kind":"task","labels":["plan-key:invariant-inv-008","invariant","quality","req:inv-008","req:phase-a"],"parent":"bn-2br8","size":"s","title":"INV-008 — Typed inconclusiveness"}	blake3:i1sqc5bV64KjmHmuegmVQNpkxfkXfWFLd8RWHOfK3lw
