1785346293923372	continuum-planner	itc:v3:AWLJM-cnJyfyRAAAAAAAQdW-666_qAAAAAEuhQ8		item.create	bn-1eqtr	{"description":"# Authoritative requirement\n`INV-003` — No prose-only machine interfaces\nSource: `notes/plan/plan.md:315`.\n\n# Contract\nHuman text may accompany a result, but agents and integrations consume versioned schemas and enums.\n\n# Delivery and evidence\nImplement the invariant as an executable architectural guard and permanent regression. Include a mutant that would violate it and prove the guard detects it.\n\n- [ ] Implementation, policy, or experiment is complete at the cited scope.\n- [ ] Positive, negative, and boundary evidence is retained under stable artifact IDs.\n- [ ] Relevant clean, incremental, mutation, security, and documentation gates pass.\n- [ ] The requirement label remains attached to the evidence-owning Bone.","kind":"task","labels":["plan-key:invariant-inv-003","invariant","quality","req:inv-003","req:phase-a"],"parent":"bn-2br87","size":"s","title":"INV-003 — No prose-only machine interfaces"}	blake3:EHlNVMTELWhfn7N1DVskqUpimN_bG8eFhkQA7v56BmU
1785346293957027	continuum-planner	itc:v3:AWLJM-cnJyfyRAAAAAAAQdW-666_qAAAAAEuhg8		item.create	bn-11yxu	{"description":"# Authoritative requirement\n`INV-004` — No self-certification\nSource: `notes/plan/plan.md:319`.\n\n# Contract\nSearch code does not check its own strongest claims. Certificates cross an independent checker; foundational theorems cross Lean.\n\n# Delivery and evidence\nImplement the invariant as an executable architectural guard and permanent regression. Include a mutant that would violate it and prove the guard detects it.\n\n- [ ] Implementation, policy, or experiment is complete at the cited scope.\n- [ ] Positive, negative, and boundary evidence is retained under stable artifact IDs.\n- [ ] Relevant clean, incremental, mutation, security, and documentation gates pass.\n- [ ] The requirement label remains attached to the evidence-owning Bone.","kind":"task","labels":["plan-key:invariant-inv-004","invariant","quality","req:inv-004","req:phase-a"],"parent":"bn-2br87","size":"s","title":"INV-004 — No self-certification"}	blake3:sr9US7N7jLey3cncEYPQAhQDD9Ks4KjygvgNsnEj2_4
