1785346294027649	continuum-planner	itc:v3:AWLJM-cnJyfyRAAAAAAAQdW-666_qAAAAAEuiA8		item.create	bn-2eegc	{"description":"# Authoritative requirement\n`INV-006` — Replay stability\nSource: `notes/plan/plan.md:327`.\n\n# Contract\nA failure advertised as replayable must reproduce under its pinned semantic epoch or be downgraded to an engine defect.\n\n# Delivery and evidence\nImplement the invariant as an executable architectural guard and permanent regression. Include a mutant that would violate it and prove the guard detects it.\n\n- [ ] Implementation, policy, or experiment is complete at the cited scope.\n- [ ] Positive, negative, and boundary evidence is retained under stable artifact IDs.\n- [ ] Relevant clean, incremental, mutation, security, and documentation gates pass.\n- [ ] The requirement label remains attached to the evidence-owning Bone.","kind":"task","labels":["plan-key:invariant-inv-006","invariant","quality","req:inv-006","req:phase-a"],"parent":"bn-2br87","size":"s","title":"INV-006 — Replay stability"}	blake3:lJJUKsm2auDDwFjVe-q3F4DUpllMYwQbhhPtaH3YYcc
