1785346294485875	continuum-planner	itc:v3:AWLJM-cnJyfyRAAAAAAAQdW-666_qAAAAAEulQ8		item.create	bn-svfx6	{"description":"# Authoritative requirement\n`INV-017` — Semantic atomicity of publication\nSource: `notes/plan/plan.md:371`.\n\n# Contract\nArtifacts become visible only after their content, provenance, and references are durably committed.\n\n# Delivery and evidence\nImplement the invariant as an executable architectural guard and permanent regression. Include a mutant that would violate it and prove the guard detects it.\n\n- [ ] Implementation, policy, or experiment is complete at the cited scope.\n- [ ] Positive, negative, and boundary evidence is retained under stable artifact IDs.\n- [ ] Relevant clean, incremental, mutation, security, and documentation gates pass.\n- [ ] The requirement label remains attached to the evidence-owning Bone.","kind":"task","labels":["plan-key:invariant-inv-017","invariant","quality","req:inv-017","req:phase-b"],"parent":"bn-2pg1j","size":"s","title":"INV-017 — Semantic atomicity of publication"}	blake3:V5cFtMXf30TC4w0LZBUnmUvDJsFhiKtM-g9xwyByAdw
