1785346294633178	continuum-planner	itc:v3:AWLJM-cnJyfyRAAAAAAAQdW-666_qAAAAAEumQ8		item.create	bn-19upp	{"description":"# Authoritative requirement\n`PO-MOD-001` — Initial satisfiability\nSource: `notes/plan/docs/16_PROOF_OBLIGATIONS.md:7`.\n\n# Contract\nThere exists at least one state satisfying Init, unless emptiness is explicitly expected.\n\n# Delivery and evidence\nImplement the generating-side check, independent checking path, malformed-evidence mutants, and receipt fields for this obligation. Kernel acceptance is the authority.\n\n- [ ] Implementation, policy, or experiment is complete at the cited scope.\n- [ ] Positive, negative, and boundary evidence is retained under stable artifact IDs.\n- [ ] Relevant clean, incremental, mutation, security, and documentation gates pass.\n- [ ] The requirement label remains attached to the evidence-owning Bone.","kind":"task","labels":["plan-key:proof-obligation-po-mod-001","proof-obligation","quality","req:phase-d","req:po-mod-001"],"parent":"bn-8c9pj","size":"s","title":"PO-MOD-001 — Initial satisfiability"}	blake3:khiPXflzmn1z5rk-i6nw8k4eSfvitKcB3LfT1sAygOk
