1785537674166384	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyzAM		item.comment	bn-2bu	{"body":"Ratified FR causal minimization: quote-id=causal-minimization-core-ratio - replay-preserving causal core must be <=10% of trace length at the corpus median over research/26's experiment corpus of real failures (traces produced by an actual defect, no semantically inert padding, per plan section 25). Kept the drafted 10% because the only executed evidence (G0-DX-01's 200->4, ~2%) is bounded by section 25 to a synthetic trace and cannot license a tighter number; added a minimal corpus qualifier plus median aggregation so the number is measurable. Kill (minimization cost dominates verification) and fallback (1-minimal delta debugging only) unchanged. Validator: status pass, ratified_quotes_checked=1; PLAN_REQUIREMENTS.json regenerated via tools/generate_traceability.py."}	blake3:W5clnaPFCqHbchrGfjbvwU8GJD_dQMSce9ijK3qJ1Tk
1785537725094002	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyzQM		item.move	bn-2bu	{"state":"done"}	blake3:A91RYVSMF_Xen6jiCV9kIam7GpYyp5exdIp2MAy6C2w
1785537768262476	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyzgM		item.comment	bn-hii	{"body":"Ratified the general context compilation (§6) win margin. Threshold (owned by research/32, quote-id=context-compilation-win-margin, quoted verbatim in plan.md §24.5): the Context Pack condition wins the ablation only if, on the held-out ContinuumBench diagnosis-and-repair split graded by research/33's independent grader with model, scaffold and token budget held equal, it beats the raw-trace baseline by at least 10 percentage points of absolute task success with a 95 percent bootstrap CI on the paired difference excluding zero, while delivering at least a 10x median per-task reduction in context bytes counting every expansion and staying within 2 percentage points of the raw-trace baseline on hidden-variant generalization. Rationale: rate-distortion (research/32) means reduction alone is worthless, so the margin conjoins a rate term, a distortion term and a non-inferiority guard; 10x is the program's existing floor from G0-DX-01 (spike measured 23.62x, 17645 -> 747 bytes, and docs/53 bounds that to the artifact shape, not the general compiler); matched budget applies research/33 principle 5 so the pack cannot win by spending more; the 2pp hidden-variant band targets this note's kill criterion (compact packs inducing incorrect repairs despite preservation checks). Kill clause and fallback (plain causal slice + expansion) unchanged; 'draft' removed from this row only. Files: research/32 (marker + rationale), plan.md §24.5 row, regenerated notes/PLAN_REQUIREMENTS.json (register threshold is a generated field). Validator: pass, program_status ready, register_rows ratified_quotes_checked=1. Commit 2d05a7d in workspace bn-hii."}	blake3:9AKdYLiMvuXAWQSVzOmvDItDoQmf6A6RCfwkIFpM8_k
1785537808032772	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyzwM		item.comment	bn-2fj	{"body":"Ratified the ACI row (frontier register 24.5) with quote-id=aci-benchmark-margins. Margins: >=10 percentage points absolute task-success gain over the disciplined-shell baseline; >=30% fewer interface bytes per solved task (bytes, not tokens, per RFC 0027's rejection of token-denominated enforcement); >=50% relative reduction in invalid-action rate; every metric paired per task over >=3 seeds with the success margin's one-sided 95% lower bound above zero; missing any one margin fails G0-DX-10 and forces protocol redesign before freeze. Rationale (research/25, new section 'Ratified margins (frontier register: ACI)'): the note proposed no numbers, so the three margins are derived from its own experiment 1 and metric list and mapped one-to-one onto the three register kills (typed surface loses to disciplined shell / schema churn dominates agent cost / handles do not reduce invalid-action rate); 10pp is the smallest gap distinguishable from seed noise at PR 10's corpus size while still demanding against a disciplined baseline, 30% bytes-per-solved-task prevents winning by failing early and cheaply, 50% invalid-action reduction tests the validity criterion and the semantic action grammar. Files: notes/plan/research/25-agent-computer-interfaces-for-formal-systems.md (new section appended), notes/plan/plan.md line 2581 (row only; kills clause kept, 'draft' removed), notes/plan/notes/PLAN_REQUIREMENTS.json (regenerated via tools/generate_traceability.py, required because the registry mirrors the register threshold cell). Validator: uv run --with jsonschema python3 tools/validate_dossier.py -> status pass, register_rows ratified_quotes_checked=1, rows=21. Commit 03172d1."}	blake3:zVrgr97euIHsJiWllDOvH1Ej-z9VRS1DDvoBo-R4jdo
