1785540613436660	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyoAQ		item.comment	bn-1cw	{"body":"IDL authored at notes/plan/schemas/continuumd-native-protocol.idl (2893 lines; all 72 plan §10.2 operations, request/result envelopes, six-epoch epochs object, connection handshake/capability negotiation, full §10.3 error taxonomy, 25 normative rules; authority clauses checked equal to RFC 0027's table). RFC 0026 points at it as normative (Normative IDL header + IDL-and-versioning bullet); corrected the result-envelope epochs row to the six epochs plus engine identity and resolved the IDL-technology open question. SD-01 marked paid in plan.md §25; traceability regenerated (SD-01 active->satisfied); validate_dossier.py status: pass. Commit dc36fce."}	blake3:tXDVZ6wEvZXWcOsin6p4MTPIiSQiX9E_4hsWZ5Tn9Kk
