1785540727184983	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyqQQ		item.create	bn-1hg4o	{"description":"Follow-up from bn-1cw: the sd01 predicate in validate_dossier.py only globs for an *idl* file. The IDL (schemas/continuumd-native-protocol.idl) states rule conformance.registry_agreement, and bn-1cw verified 72/72 operation set-equality with plan §10.2 and 72/72 authority agreement with RFC 0027 ad hoc — a ~15-line predicate would make both mechanical in CI. Also note: the IDL registered new wire-visible vocabularies (Encoding, Audience, DiffLayer, TargetKind, ExplorationStrategy, StructuralOutcome, DiagnosticSeverity, TaskEventKind, EvidenceEventKind; Portfolio and ExplanationLevel promoted from sketches) — these are new decisions needing a reviewer's eye during the RFC 0026 expansion bone.","kind":"task","title":"chore: harden check_spec_debt sd01 — enforce IDL/§10.2 registry agreement mechanically"}	blake3:mlHcqkctof0t_9SPdO15n1Uh3VIScD338CC1MbfU4cM
